  logKow of ibuprofen between 1-octanol and water.

  ARITY 3: this is a SYSTEM property, not an intrinsic component field.
  Reclassified 2026-07-24 out of a comment line in
  data/tmp/components/ibuprofen.candidate.dat  (RECORD_SPEC.md arity rule:
